@startuml
!include ../../architecture/render-skin.puml
title <size:24>Dynamic View: Android MCP bridge - Android bridge APK</size>\n<size:24>Fresh owner capability bound to exact CAS command</size>

set separator none
hide stereotype

<style>
  root {
    BackgroundColor: #ffffff;
    FontColor: #444444;
  }
  // Element
  .Element-RWxlbWVudA== {
    BackgroundColor: #edf3f8;
    LineColor: #34526b;
    LineStyle: 0;
    LineThickness: 2;
    FontColor: #17212b;
    FontSize: 24;
    HorizontalAlignment: center;
    Shadowing: 0;
    MaximumWidth: 450;
  }
  // Element,Person
  .Element-RWxlbWVudCxQZXJzb24= {
    BackgroundColor: #edf3f8;
    LineColor: #34526b;
    LineStyle: 0;
    LineThickness: 2;
    FontColor: #34526b;
    FontSize: 24;
    HorizontalAlignment: center;
    Shadowing: 0;
    MaximumWidth: 450;
  }
  // Relationship
  .Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw {
    LineThickness: 2;
    LineStyle: 10-10;
    LineColor: #34526b;
    FontColor: #34526b;
    FontSize: 20;
  }
</style>

actor "Local owner\n<size:16>[Person]</size>" as Localowner <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxQZXJzb24=>>
participant "Compose management UI\n<size:16>[Component: Kotlin / Compose]</size>" as AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.ComposemanagementUI <<Element-RWxlbWVudA==>>
participant "OwnerCommandFacade\n<size:16>[Component: Kotlin]</size>" as AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.OwnerCommandFacade <<Element-RWxlbWVudA==>>
participant "AdmissionGate\n<size:16>[Component: Kotlin]</size>" as AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.AdmissionGate <<Element-RWxlbWVudA==>>
participant "CatalogRepository\n<size:16>[Component: Kotlin / SQLite]</size>" as AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.CatalogRepository <<Element-RWxlbWVudA==>>

Localowner -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.ComposemanagementUI <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 1: Choose protected command and inspect exact scope/revisions
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.ComposemanagementUI -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.OwnerCommandFacade <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 2: Request nonce and protected authentication challenge
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.OwnerCommandFacade -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.ComposemanagementUI <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 3: Service quiesces/drains every bridge remote-input path before requesting protected OS prompt
Localowner -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.ComposemanagementUI <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 4: Complete protected OS biometric/device credential prompt or deny/cancel
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.ComposemanagementUI -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.OwnerCommandFacade <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 5: Deliver platform-auth completion bound to service challenge; no JSON owner assertion
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.OwnerCommandFacade -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.AdmissionGate <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 6: Validate fresh owner capability and current command/revisions
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.OwnerCommandFacade -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.CatalogRepository <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 7: Verify-and-consume capability at serialized CAS commit; reject mismatch
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.OwnerCommandFacade -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.ComposemanagementUI <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 8: Return committed revision or denial/conflict; no remote self-approval

@enduml